         it rides the BOTTOM of the band below y~2 and the TOP above it, then holds nu flat at ~1.128 all the way to y~1e5 before dropping.  I.e. it DEFERS the Newtonian approach to accelerations far above the RAR window, where Jhat has decayed as y^{-1/2}, and parks the residual boost as a CONSTANT factor that is exactly degenerate with GM_sun.  mu_n instead SHARPENS the transition.  Two structurally different escapes, both inside nu alone.

